uardian.com/football/2026/nov/22/mauricio-pochettino-manchester-united-reign-begins-with-anfield-humiliation-liverpool", "date": "2026-11-22T21:31:03Z"}, {"name": "BBC Sport", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/videos/cq23jmklrj33o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "date": "2026-11-22T23:59:59Z"}]}, {"text": "Liverpool's win takes them to fourth in the Premier League. They also reached 700 Premier League wins.", "label": "confirmed", "sources": [{"name": "The Guardian", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/video/2026/nov/22/we-feel-the-pain-pochettino-on-4-0-defeat-at-liverpool-to-start-manchester-united-era-video", "date": "2026-11-22T23:33:33Z"}, {"name": "Liverpool FC", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQbjFKUXhQLUdOMDJCdVBRTjAtYmQtaThBUHVVWE9KbTdwYjZ0TEZmOGRNd19NNUh2LU5QNXp3cVNYenFRNldLRUgyNWdUQXRCNWtxSzRldE1iOWM5RlRUZ3ptUVdqcDBwUUtaT05KaXRiUENTbmtaZ2NwaWpfM3ZQd0NiY3dKYjJZMkFXX2ZPOWEwanRhVXc?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-22T20:31:33Z"}]}, {"text": "Gary Neville said United's leaders were negligent for not strengthening the defence. United have the worst defensive record in Europe, he said.", "label": "opinion", "sources": [{"name": "Sky Sports", "url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13615413/liverpool-4-0-man-utd-gary-neville-on-matthijs-de-ligt-selection-and-negligent-red-devils", "date": "2026-11-22T20:25:00Z"}]}], "updated": "2026-11-23T00:59:37Z"}}